## 2. Can the agent now expose a TOTALDEMAND value before its publication time?
# Ingest gives the price row and the TOTALDEMAND row of an interval the same publication and availability times (both
# from the same dispatch file: ingest._prov). get_price_timeline filters on the price row's availability, and is the
# only tool that reads the TOTALDEMAND table; compare_forecast_actual refuses DISPATCH_TOTALDEMAND.
